ic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 19 m long."},{"id":"marker72","name":"Redckerby Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 28 m long."},{"id":"marker73","name":"Preston Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 17 m long."},{"id":"marker74","name":"Fenzan Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 21 m long."},{"id":"marker75","name":"Grantle Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 35 m long."},{"id":"marker76","name":"Aksoshish Cyclops","legend":"Locals speak of a great Cyclops who inhabits Aksoshish hills and harasses travelers in the area."},{"id":"marker77","name":"Kuranpaa Roc","legend":"Elders speak of a big Roc who inhabits Kuranpaa hills and doesn't mind human flesh."},{"id":"marker78","name":"Mauni Roc","legend":"Locals speak of a lucky Roc who inhabits Mauni hills and snatches people from homes."},{"id":"marker79","name":"Abrossos Giant","legend":"Locals speak of a horrifying Giant who inhabits Abrossos hills and steals cattle at night."},{"id":"marker80","name":"Goli Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Amponism."},{"id":"marker81","name":"Imbdelelos Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Witnesses of Schallstad."},{"id":"marker82","name":"Staponionti Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Witnesses of Schallstad."},{"id":"marker83","name":"Lecenainon Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Amponism."},{"id":"marker84","name":"Cigunum Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Ruteborum Dissent."},{"id":"marker85","name":"Egane Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Hellenic Faith."},{"id":"marker86","name":"Ofin Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Witnesses of Schallstad."},{"id":"marker87","name":"Pepoirakynt Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Witnesses of Schallstad."},{"id":"marker88","name":"Schongengen Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Witnesses of Schallstad."},{"id":"marker89","name":"Marnoma Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Witnesses of Schallstad."},{"id":"marker90","name":"Monutgerd Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Tziriloh Religion."},{"id":"marker91","name":"Rigurodula Bisons","legend":"A gang of forest highwaymen."},{"id":"marker92","name":"Martus Wolfs","legend":"A gang of mounted robbers."},{"id":"marker93","name":"Bigantium Spiders","legend":"A gang of forest highwaymen."},{"id":"marker94","name":"Dizina Rooks","legend":"A gang of mounted brigands."},{"id":"marker95","name":"Calwand Ravens","legend":"A gang of forest robbers."},{"id":"marker96","name":"Siunkyvasma Sharks","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker97","name":"Stuhtal Beavers","legend":"A gang of forest highwaymen."},{"id":"marker98","name":"Hainelach Hawks","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker99","name":"Qarthel Tigers","legend":"A gang of swamp highwaymen."},{"id":"marker100","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker101","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker102","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker103","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker104","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker105","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker106","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker107","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker108","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker109","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker110","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker111","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker112","name":"Ampi Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠠᡭᢐᠡ᠒ᡒᠡᢥᢡ᠒ᠨᡡᡯᠡᢡᠳᡗᢒᢏᡁᢟᡝᢏᢟ᠑ᢋᢟᠩᢠᠦᡝᠿᡔᠪᢜᢞᡎᡲᡡᢓᢛᡟᡮᠿᠩᢏᠼᠻᡳᢑᠽᡑᠵᡝᢒᡔ</div>"},{"id":"marker113","name":"Capulagusta Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳑ ⳥⳾ⳞⲴⳃⳃⳆⳀⳖ ⳾ⳘⳞⳐ⳹⳩ⳈⳌⲴⳞⳬⳲ Ⳅ⳧ⳒⲴⳘⳁ⳩ⲺⲾⲾ⳪Ⳝ⳪ ⳜⳊⳊⳈⳖⳫⳆ Ⳏ⳧ⲺⲾⳲⳀⳄⲼ⳥ⳀⳆⳘⳤⳃ⳩⳪ⳞⳁⳐⳊ⳾ⳒⳜⳲⳖⲺⳚⳭⳀⳭ ⳁⲶⳭⲸⲼ⳥ⳀⳆⳀ</div>"},{"id":"marker114","name":"Tibeon Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳠⲴⳄⳬⳘⳈⳀⳚⳊⳔ⳾ⳎⳀⲾⳖⲼⳈⳊⲴⳤⳂⳌⲾ ⳫⳘⳬⳄⳊⳌⳭⲾⳖⳘⳂⳃⳚ⳥ⳢⲸ⳩ⳄⳞⳤⳬⳁⳲ⳥ⳎⲺⳲⳊⳫ⳩ⳊⳘⳫⳒⳒ</div>"},{"id":"marker115","name":"Coniaquliob Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༇༊༐༮༒༶༼༔༕༕༐༿༘༻༇༣་་༙༼༈༬༷༈༶༰༯༆༻༦༵༶༼༴༄༗༸༴༰༉༲༨༗༺༜༷༅༃༸༘༳ༀ༫༊༺༫༻༑༼༙༽༢༸༿༚༁༴</div>"},{"id":"marker116","name":"Khatan Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc33𐠴\udc33 \udc18𐠅\udc35\udc29\udc32𐠩\udc11\udc10\udc29\udc3f𐠘𐠣\udc2b\udc0e\udc1e\udc2f\udc08\udc2c\udc3f\udc2e\udc14\udc19\udc2f\ud802𐠄\udc11\udc19\udc0a\udc2e\udc08\udc2b</div>"},{"id":"marker117","name":"Viljanas Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">᠀ᢏᡐᠧᡯᠠᢏᡮᢑᢐᡞᠻᢀᠦᢁᢥᢂᠱᡲᠻᡮᡓᠽᡱᡖᠻᢁᡆᡗᠿᡝᠭᢒᡓᢛᡁᡝᠯᢐᢓᡡᢢ᠒ᡆ᠒ᠾᡮᡎᠡᠱᠡᠦᡓᡖᡆᢏᢐᡒᡑᢓ</div>"},{"id":"marker118","name":"Parvioval Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡞᢒᠲᢀᡱᡰᡜᠵᠿᡗᡁᢡᡗᢏᡗᡝᠡᡁᠱᠾᡞᠼᢒᡙᢞᡞᠡᠡᡗᡳᡡᡑᡜᠽᠨᢁᢥ᠑ᢦᡙᡜᡑᡯᡯᡑᡍᡖᠽᠿᢥᠩᠵᠿᡆᡮᡜ᠐ᡰᠧᡰᡯᡎᠨᡱᠽᢠᡍᡱ᠐ᠵᡜ᠀ᢀᡭᢢᢠᠱᡝᢜᡯᠻᢢᠧᠳᡔᡠᡙᠦᢦᢓᡰᠵ</div>"},{"id":"marker119","name":"Aidolis Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc1f\udc24𐠋\udc20\udc05\udc0e\udc19\udc16𐠋 \udc31𐠫𐠣𐠱\udc21𐠟\udc03\ud802 \udc04\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠄\ud802𐠈\udc1b\ud802𐠡\udc35𐠞𐠕\udc2b\ud802𐠦𐠃𐠃\ud802𐠿\ud802𐠪\ud802𐠮\udc22\udc0b𐠞\ud802𐠱\udc2b𐠴\ud802𐠏\ud802𐠘\ud802𐠢\udc08\udc14\ud802\ud802𐠭\udc03\ud802\ud802𐠟</div>"},{"id":"marker120","name":"Kalenialica Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༯༭༣༫༢༖༛༅༿༛༠༧༃༿༑༵༛༉༸༨༩༶༯༯༻༥༡༻༩༶༜༂༢༿༡ༀ༭༈༙༰༧༵༊༻༱༦༥༽༬༷༭༹༁༷༿༉་༖༆༷༨༚༠༪༕༗༭༛༚༗</div>"},{"id":"marker121","name":"Gethema Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠲᡏᡆᡏᢐᠡᠯᡰᡐᡞᠼᢥᠮᡑᡔᠰᠿᡟᢥᡠᡔᠨᡔᡴ᠐ᠵᢠᢡᡮᢑᢐᢤᢓᡮᡙᠳᠠᠩᠭᡙᡀᠻᢋᢡᡜᠭᠾᠭᠰᢞᢂᡭᠽᠳᡗᡱᡯᠧᢠᡙᢦ</div>"},{"id":"marker122","name":"Eusis Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">᠑ᢒᠿᡗᡞᢞᡯᡟᡐᡳᡑᡗᢜᡯᡝᠼᢂᢦᢥᡔᡖ᠑ᡒᠻᠩᠯᠵᡏᠭᢏᡞᠦᠯ᠒᠑ᢀᢋᡝᡗᠵᠽᡟᠮᢦᠯᢐᢓᡮᠩᡭᠻᡰᡓ᠀ᢁᠦᠭ</div>"},{"id":"marker123","name":"Codunum Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༙༷༸༖༅༭༿༻༡༑༲༁༊༔༐༳༺༿ༀ༷༡ༀ༫༁༿༶༧༂༶༨༧༣༠༦༇༯༯༆༰༨༐་༑༥༛</div>"},{"id":"marker124","name":"Ribethre Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳑ⳧⳹ⳖⲼⳄⳐⳞⳤⳞⳭⳔⲾⲾ ⳜⲸⳌⳐⳖⳄ⳩ⳭⲼⲶⲺⳀⳞⳆ ⲲⲴⳞ⳹ⳬⳈⳀⳬⳞⲺ ⲼⳢⳘⳔ⳧ ⳾ⳤ⳪Ⳬ⳪ⳀⲾ⳹⳥Ⳗ⳹ⳲⳁⳫⳜⳞⳫⳠ⳥ⳠⳃⳌⳈⲼⳜⳫⳞⳢ⳥⳩ⲶⳠⳖⳠⲲⳤⳌⲶⳚⲲ Ⲿ</div>"},{"id":"marker125","name":"Aichenzelnma Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༌༵༾༾༱༢༜༫༺༿༢༺༙༵༙༖༥༠༚༈༅༇༐༄༑༮༩༊༦༿༥༰༚༾༲་༼༜༺༅༙༓༕༇༯༨༻༮༩༩༽༲༵༥༪༢༧༿༪༇༺༱༚༰༈༭༨༜༧༃༥༹༤༨ༀ༗༨༛་༣༔༨༣༠༰༓༡༹༫༉༽</div>"},{"id":"marker126","name":"Garehem Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ጠፈሀበደዘ  ጠበደረየ ፀሰመጰዐጸተደበዘሀጸዘየተ ገተሀሠደ ነከኀመሀጰቀረፀነዐዐፀነየረ ተተነለአፐፈዘሐዐደጸለአፈደፀየቀበሠ ለፀከከዘፀቀገጰመገ  ፈወፀጰ</div>"},{"id":"marker127","name":"Dodeck Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༐༧༰༁༴༜༥༙༇༼༮༿༡༖༮༹༘༜༫༕༱༹༬༌༔༾༶༺༗༺༅༓༴༜༥༤༘༮༿༼༇༹༔༤༩༕༹༇༴༪༜་༶༒༹༉༸༂༻༫༽</div>"},{"id":"marker128","name":"Geliavumbia Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠭\udc10𐠠\udc3c\udc37𐠥𐠬𐠯𐠬\udc24\ud802𐠳\udc33\udc0a𐠡\udc38\udc2d\udc37\udc18𐠞\udc29\ud802𐠤𐠑\udc20\udc0b\ud802𐠐\udc27\udc0f\udc3f\udc30\udc33\ud802𐠵\udc17\ud802\ud802\ud802 \ud802𐠰\ud802𐠁\ud802𐠿𐠪\udc02\ud802𐠵\ud802𐠜𐠼\ud802\ud802𐠸\ud802\ud802𐠐\udc13 \udc03\udc31\udc33𐠈\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker129","name":"Ruined Fortification","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker130","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker131","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker132","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker133","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker134","name":"Ruined City","legend":"